": "439398765677918", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43931331_439398769011251_6832019495182883720_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zUHRGqdZt7UQ7kNvwFoA0Rt&_nc_oc=AdpV0WA9bZd0IWpjqIKnRr5KtgZwbqbOekMVTBaFbW67OTRXGMeVGSwv89ICfa9dCvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOF-Ra4rjMENgR1Nw5TyDugFY-tpZ6Fm3RM30Fp_8WzGQ&oe=6ABFD899"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "800507275395357", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974714_800507278728690_8370916924605575234_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=inb6q0AhQ04Q7kNvwFGIfXH&_nc_oc=AdoL0JH05ZLtFWtK4V0FkWCek9jo5s_qk3Aygd5lRlJMIkGO0Swc9FV0w2pJWWLlDJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOq_1RS0I_sqJy5U6AE5318ByyrnWBfIRnN56LhLMPc1w&oe=6ABFB283"}, {"file_name": "Untitled.png", "id": "332917583088461", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035363_332917586421794_8831279654688852183_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xAhrVQPwYX0Q7kNvwEaytF2&_nc_oc=AdpejVgkoCi2THmH47E6U45QRgditU3mZx0UfUIMJqq2EcA0IfepiMn9DYKOoDReIlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOWBJBxs7d1RxuGh3zNLJELfZapmJ3seW8GS4qOdDRPQw&oe=6ABFBB67"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Group 59.png", "id": "1524970634865802", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984452_1524970638199135_826433915348957463_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O0zKnowir-YQ7kNvwHQ9yRG&_nc_oc=AdoueCLzhPUpFj2lqrX7wx68AVHKnyqUzutpnpVMeslkwAZPFVYK4fM3dOacJlhegEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNMjlfokZhhhFwOLetly6W4BThxhwg_Nr9knt7iWoiHOg&oe=6ABFB5CC"}, "display_name": "Brick Mania", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\n\n\ud83e\udd8d **BRICK MANIA: UNLEASH YOUR INNER BRICK \ud83e\udd8d**\n\nShrink down to action figure size and explore an exciting room as a brick. With no legs and a lot of personality, you\u2019ll run on your hands through various fun-filled activities.  \n\n\ud83e\udda0 **BUILT IN MODS** \ud83e\udda0\n\nExplore the COOLEST mods that are easy to get. Rockets, Fly, No Clip, Speed Hacks, X Ray, Teleport, Laptop, and much more!\n\n\ud83d\udcf8 **FREE CAMERA MOD: MOST ADVANCED CAMERA \ud83d\udcf8**\n\nOur built-in camera mod lets you switch between first-person, third-person, and other exciting perspectives to enhance your gameplay experience.\n\n\ud83c\udfe0 **GAME MODES\ud83c\udfe0**\n\nHave fun and talk with other bricks in our casual mode or show your inner brick and jump into an infection lobby. More game modes soon to come..\n\n\u2757\ufe0f\u2757\ufe0f**BIG UPDATES CONSTANTLY\u2757\ufe0f\u2757\ufe0f**\n\nWe do our best to get out updates every week or every other week to best support our community. We built what the community wants!\n\n\n\ud83c\udfc0 **SHOOT HOOPS LIKE NEVER BEFORE** \ud83c\udfc0 \n\nHit the basketball court for some epic trick shots. Whether you\u2019re a baller or just want hit some jumpers, the court is yours.\n\n\n\n\n\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f **EXPLORE THE MALL AND GET COSMETICS \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f**\n\nVisit our in-game mall and deck out your brick with an array of cosmetics. From funky outfits to stylish accessories, there\u2019s something for everyone.\n\n\ud83e\udd73 **JOIN THE BRICK MANIA NOW \ud83e\udd73**\n\nReady to experience life as a brick? Join the Brick Mania now and embark on a tiny, yet massive adventure. Play for free and let the fun begin! Join our Discord to get support or find people to play with: https://discord.gg/brickmania", "short_description": "Step into the shoes of a miniature, brick in a room-sized adventure.Run, Jump, Tag, Shoot hoops, Explore mods, take videos using in game camera mod, and customize your look at the in-game mall."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.gotmotion.gg/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Got Motion", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gotmotion.gg/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "7775382612575240"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031358_1008229424144764_8454664177896328679_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=enAwnE4fvXsQ7kNvwHemiOn&_nc_oc=AdrJVLwXqLA-T_ESWy69VyGf6_CX1-OwzLgho510ysktq8qJYPfmVJYiKSHjgYge6Bs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMYBUvdnHR-fRywNCxcrLqYjJtwH4AMvm9Gp2cEiJ_LZQ&oe=6ABFB7EC"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Brick Mania", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}], "release_date": 1722647181, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "7775382652575236", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7775382595908575", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "7748837421911311"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Group 60 (1).png", "id": "1008229420811431", 